      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduced Cr–Zr interdiffusion will preserve coating structural integrity during high-temperature steam exposure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Si-doped Cr coating will maintain oxidation resistance during accident-relevant high-temperature steam exposure.",
